https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20603  fixed

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend914_db56_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend914_db56_min;
USE repro_databend914_db56_min;

CREATE TABLE source (
    id INT,
    a ARRAY(INT) NULL
) ENGINE=FUSE;

CREATE TABLE part_l (
    id INT
) ENGINE=FUSE;

CREATE TABLE part_r (
    id INT,
    a ARRAY(INT) NULL
) ENGINE=FUSE;

INSERT INTO source VALUES (1, NULL);
INSERT INTO part_l SELECT id FROM source;
INSERT INTO part_r SELECT id, a FROM source;

SELECT ARRAY_AGG(a)
FROM source;

SELECT ARRAY_AGG(r.a)
FROM part_l AS l
JOIN part_r AS r ON l.id = r.id;

单表查询实际结果：
[]

拆分后的多表查询实际结果：
[[]]

单表：
AggregatePartial
└── TableScan(source)
    output: [a]

多表：
AggregatePartial
└── HashJoin
    output: [r.a]
    ├── TableScan(part_r)
    └── TableScan(part_l)

ARRAY_AGG 在 AggregatePartial 中直接消费 HashJoin 输出的 nullable ARRAY 列时，没有正确识别 NULL，而是把 NULL 当成了空数组 []，导致聚合结果从 [] 变成 [[]]。